\" ><strong>Your car is your lifeline</strong> \u2014 your best friend. Equip it with extra fuel tanks, storage units, food preservation tools, and tracking devices to help you scavenge deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/cde801883fa48c08c892474de49eaf50.poster.avif?t=1766178369\" width=616 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/cde801883fa48c08c892474de49eaf50.webm?t=1766178369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/cde801883fa48c08c892474de49eaf50.mp4?t=1766178369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric third-person exploration with stylized low-poly visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle yet emotional solo journey about hope and isolation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial open world: freedom to explore each zone before driving onward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light crafting system and satisfying loot mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode (approx. 5+ hours planned) and Endless Infinity Mode with unique content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. Just survival, exploration, and your bond with the road.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/b69672dacf815595b0491005d5deea8c.poster.avif?t=1766178369\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/b69672dacf815595b0491005d5deea8c.webm?t=1766178369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/b69672dacf815595b0491005d5deea8c.mp4?t=1766178369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of slow-paced survival, cozy indies, or reflective adventures \u2014 this is a game made to be felt, not rushed.</p>","developers":["Dark Gravity Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/c4f2b1a3e673eca8c063257257b84b8f87365c73/header.jpg?t=1766178369","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Dark Gravity Games. Game title and all associated assets are the property of Dark Gravity Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3858260/943862187/e9b2c4a65db722428967f457c5a14748a89916dd/1766177431/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766178366","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3858260/943862187/e9b2c4a65db722428967f457c5a14748a89916dd/1766177431/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766178366","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3858260/943862187/e9b2c4a65db722428967f457c5a14748a89916dd/1766177431/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766178366","id":257252944,"name":"Nothing But Road teaser 2025.12.19","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257252944/aee1dd26039c894960341c244f8432d2470540be/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766178366"}],"name":"Nothing But Road","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stro